{
  "name": "bearing_bracket_topopt",
  "project": "eval:bearing-bracket-topopt",
  "difficulty": 3,
  "description": "Generative design — prompt declares ONLY the interfaces (3x M8 bolt pattern + dia-30 bearing bore) inside a 120x70x90 envelope; codegen builds a solid design-space seed, FEM sanity-checks the case, SIMP (keep_mode auto, yz symmetry) designs the structure, refine restores exact bores/planes.",
  "settings": {
    "gen_mode": "cad"
  },
  "stages": [
    {
      "id": "codegen",
      "type": "generate",
      "mode": "cad",
      "timeout_s": 5400,
      "options": {
        "process": "fdm"
      },
      "prompt": "Design-space seed for a topology-optimized bearing bracket (aluminium 6061), parametric.\n\nThis body is the design envelope for a topology optimization — it is NOT the final part. Build ONE watertight solid that fills the envelope as fully as practical; a plain block is a perfectly good answer. Do NOT add ribs, pockets, thin webs, chamfers or fillets — the optimizer decides where material stays.\n\nFrame: mounting face on the XY plane (z = 0), centred in X and Y. mm.\n- Envelope (maximum design space): 120 x 70 x 90 (x × y × z).\n- Interfaces, exactly:\n  - 3 through-holes dia 8.5 along Z on the mounting plane at (x=-46, y=+22), (x=+46, y=+22) and (x=0, y=-22) — M8 bolts to the base.\n  - 1 through-bore dia 30 along Y centred at (x=0, z=65) — bearing/shaft seat.\n- Nothing else: no shape features beyond the interfaces.\nSymmetric across x = 0 (left-right).\n\nService context for the spec: bolted down through the three holes; the bore carries a ~8 kN radial shaft load downward plus a ~3 kN axial thrust along +Y.",
      "gates": [
        {
          "type": "status",
          "expect": [
            "succeeded",
            "needs_review"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "bbox",
          "dims": [
            120,
            70,
            90
          ],
          "match": "within",
          "tol_mm": 5
        },
        {
          "type": "volume",
          "min_mm3": 450000
        },
        {
          "type": "holes",
          "count": 3,
          "dia": 8.5,
          "axis": "z",
          "positions": [
            [
              -46,
              22
            ],
            [
              46,
              22
            ],
            [
              0,
              -22
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "holes",
          "count": 1,
          "dia": 30,
          "axis": "y"
        },
        {
          "type": "watertight",
          "expect": true
        },
        {
          "type": "verify_spec",
          "expect": "PASS"
        }
      ]
    },
